# Bot1 has Rest in Peace out on turn 1. On turn 3 Faithless Looting makes Bot1 discard Basking Rootwalla and a Mountain.
# Both madness (CR 702.35a: discard it into exile instead) and Rest in Peace (exile it instead of the graveyard) replace the
# discard; the affected player chooses the order (CR 616.1), and per the Rest in Peace ruling may apply madness first. Its
# trigger then lets Bot1 cast the Rootwalla for {0}, so it ends on the battlefield. The Mountain is plainly exiled, as is the
# Island Bot2 discarded to hand size on turn 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Rest in Peace
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Basking Rootwalla
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rest in Peace.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Basking Rootwalla; Mountain)
Bot1.Replace(madness)
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mountain; Rest in Peace; Basking Rootwalla
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Faithless Looting; Island; Mountain
